<title>USA: Toyota July US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota July US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    53,979	    47,109	    +14.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  12,623	     8,573	    +47.2</p>
<p> Import Car		18,840	    20,789	     -9.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	    23,497	    18,630	    +26.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   380,454	   331,035	    +15.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  81,939	    79,351	     +3.8</p>
<p> Import Car	     127,148	   135,553	     -5.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	   148,636	   126,266	    +18.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month  vs 26, 179 for year to date vs 180 in year ago.</p>
</text>
